<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361418" n="1"/>
  <opener>
      <lb/><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> et <abbr>Celeber.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> Viro <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti</rs>
  </opener>
  <p>
      <lb/>Quin meas <rs key="B_991170517055705501" type="letter">literas</rs> ante decem dies istuc missas un<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>
      <lb/>cum <rs key="B_991170514608105501" type="letter">iis</rs> (quas<del> a</del> <abbr>Celeber.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruus</rs> Tuus ad me trans<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>misit) acceperis, Vir <abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr>, nullus dubitandi mi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>hi relinquitur locus. Libenter tamen resciam an
      <lb/>revera easdemmet literas omnes<note type="editorial">Michelotti fragt nach dem Empfang seines <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517055705501">Briefs</rs> vom 22. April und der darin weitergeleiteten Sendung Johann I Bernoullis. Der <rs type="letter" key="B_991170514608105501">Brief</rs> Johanns an Nicolaus I vom 9. April 1718 ist erhalten; weitere Beilagen werden hier nicht einzeln genannt.</note> acceptaris. In
      <lb/>una ex tuis <rs key="B_991170517055905501" type="letter">epistolis</rs> dixisti quod pressio fluidi per<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>pendiculariter superficiem quamlibet continen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tem prementis est <add>in unoquoque puncto</add> proportionalis altitudini
      <lb/>verticali fluidi supra hoc punctum, atque ista
      <lb/>altitudo quo singulis sectionis horizontalis punctis
      <lb/>eadem. Peto a Te huius <abbr>proposi.<hi rend="sup">is</hi></abbr> demonstratio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nem, quam ex Hydrostaticis p<unclear>a</unclear>tere indicasti. Spe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ro quod <abbr>Excell.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr> <abbr>Proc.<hi rend="sup">rem</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-121843858" type="person">Theupol<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> non semel
      <lb/>salutaveris.
  </p>
  <closer>Tu interim vale, et mihi impera.
      <lb/><dateline/>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <date when="1718-05-02"><choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> 2 Maii 1718</date>.<note hand="pers_DE-588-119166895"><foreign xml:lang="ger"><abbr>Empf.</abbr> den <date when="1718-05-03">3<hi rend="sup">ten</hi></date>.</foreign></note>
  </closer>
<pb facs="1361420" n="2" type="empty"/>
</div>
